@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 0. Crear 2 jugadores de prueba en H2
POST {{baseUrl}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Santi", "lastName": "Cazorla", "shirtNumber": 8, "birthDate": "1984-12-13", "position": "MIDFIELDER", "playerStatus": "AVAILABLE" }
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Borja", "lastName": "Bastón", "shirtNumber": 9, "birthDate": "1992-08-25", "position": "FORWARD", "playerStatus": "AVAILABLE" }

### 1. Crear sesión de entrenamiento (Esperado: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trainings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionDate": "2026-11-25T18:00:00",
  "focus": "Presión tras pérdida y transiciones rápidas",
  "durationMinutes": 90,
  "notes": "Trabajo reducido en espacio medio"
}

### 2. Registrar asistencia válida de jugador 1 (Esperado: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trainings/1/attendances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 1,
  "attendanceStatus": "PRESENT",
  "rpe": 7
}

### 3. Fallo: Ausencia justificada sin motivo (Esperado: BusinessRuleException)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trainings/1/attendances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 2,
  "attendanceStatus": "ABSENT_JUSTIFIED"
}

### 4. Fallo: Jugador ausente con RPE informado (Esperado: BusinessRuleException)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trainings/1/attendances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 2,
  "attendanceStatus": "ABSENT_UNJUSTIFIED",
  "rpe": 5
}

### 5. Registrar ausencia justificada válida de jugador 2 (Esperado: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trainings/1/attendances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 2,
  "attendanceStatus": "ABSENT_JUSTIFIED",
  "absenceReason": "Exámenes universitarios"
}

### 6. Consultar ficha completa de la sesión con asistencias (Esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/trainings/1
Accept: application/json